              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लड़ाना — laṛānā — \"to pit against; to make fight\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बच्चों ने छत पर दो पतंगें लड़ाईं। Baccoṁ ne chat par do pataṅgeṁ laṛāīṁ. On the roof the children pitted two kites against each other."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने दो पहलवानों को लड़ाया, usne do pahalvānoṁ ko laṛāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लड़ाना (laṛānā) is the causative of laṛnā, \"to fight\", from laḍ, \"fight\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 10920)."
            }
          ]
